@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed current scoped authority at consequential admission
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Untrusted caller" as C
participant "Validated entry boundary" as B
participant "Resource-owning handler" as H
participant "Current identity / scoped policy" as I
database "Owned current state" as DB
C -> B : resource / action / data / expected versions
B -> B : transport / input / session / anti-forgery checks as applicable
B -> H : bounded validated intent + verified attributable context
H -> I : current actor / resource / action eligibility
I --> H : actual scoped context or denial
H -> DB : resolve current resource / lifecycle / versions
DB --> H : actual permitted owner state
alt authorized and valid current guarded admission
 H -> H : operation invariants + synchronization with grant/state changes
 H -> DB : admitted local mutation / attributable result if applicable
 H --> C : permitted bounded result / controlled delivery context
else denied / unresolved / conflict
 H --> C : safe refusal; no unauthorized mutation or disclosure
end
note over H,DB
 Identity alone is not operation authorization.
 A cached prior allow is not an evergreen capability.
 Concrete synchronization and private serving remain evaluated mechanisms.
end note
@enduml
